Package: SurvPT
Type: Package
Title: Estimate the Survival Function from Interval Censored Data by Polya Tree
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Yixing", "Zhao",
      email = "y679zhao@uwaterloo.ca",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Estimates survival functions from censored observations using
    finite Polya trees with uniform, exponential or Weibull conditional base
    distributions. An additional Beta-prior split represents tail
    probability, and cached conditional probabilities accelerate iterative
    allocation of censored observations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.1.0), stats
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
SystemRequirements: C++17
